SG Office -- based on ONLYOFFICE
================================

SG Office is Stained Glass OS's office suite. Its engine is ONLYOFFICE's --
the sdkjs document engines, the core converter/renderer and the web-apps
editors -- developed by Ascensio System SIA (https://www.onlyoffice.com),
built from their published source at the versions in upstream.conf, with the
changes in patches/ made by Stained Glass OS contributors.

